{"ID":"20240515142929-d4hfqb2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142929-d4hfqb2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142929-d4hfqb2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143425-p15jxer\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143425-p15jxer\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:590,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143425-p15jxer\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:386,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:386\u0026#125;","title":"108","type":"doc","updated":"20240515183805"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143425-p15jxer","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 886px;","id":"20240515143425-p15jxer","updated":"20240515183805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YL"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年約70，中等身材，背微凸"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/20"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診時長期服用Baby Aspirin導致輕微中風，左唇麻且左側無力，二診時(2008/08/04)予炙甘草湯，病人服後狀況大有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三診脈仍時一止，但有力許多，體力、胃口、睡眠皆好轉，左側身麻已退，大便由便秘改善為日一行；心口痛減少，仍有一點點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今日四診時自言大便甚多，日五、六行，頭痛與目眩皆去，但左手仍有麻感，脈節拍仍稍有不齊。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）體力：轉佳，但仍未全恢復。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）胃口：轉佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）睡眠：佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）大便：日五、六行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）小便：淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）手足：轉溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）其他：頭痛暈眩皆去，左手仍麻。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有時一止，但有力許多。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔淡黃"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍是炙甘草湯證，已進步許多。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同八月六日方，加川芎三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"予五付，每付九煮成三碗，早晚餐飯前服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎可活血，可走到腦部，又可增加血管彈性，不像Aspirin反而會導致腦出血中風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草湯既然中病，就要守方，且其左手麻未去，仍是血虛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所開炙甘草湯加減並無攻下藥，但服後大便卻能日五、六行，這是因為心臟力量回復，進而使小腸蠕動速度加快，就會自動排除腸中積糞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈仍稍結代是因為小腸套疊，心血自腹主動脈下行時會受到阻礙，故心律仍不齊。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}